messages.en:
When my mom gets upset,{01 00 00 0a 00}
she breaks dishes, one by
one, until she feels better.{01 00 00 05 00}
Me?{01 00 00 05 00} I think I probably broke
{07 01 00}about 10 plates in my house
already! So back off!

messages.et:
Kui mu ema ärritub,{01 00 00 0a 00}
lõhub ta nõusid, ühe haaval,
kuni tal on parem.{01 00 00 05 00}
Mina?{01 00 00 05 00} Ma arvan, et olen
{07 01 00}umbes 10 taldrikut kodus
lõhkunud! Nii et mine ära!
